     "Service",
     "ECOCIRNOV chair developed a digital tool for managing household waste streams by local public authorities. CRTNNVERT chair created an agent based model of managing construction demolition waste (CDW). The next step envisaged for each of these tools is to create an user interface that facilitates decision-making by comparing different scenarios of management of waste as resources at regional scale.",
